# Everyday Cool Arcade — game manifest
# One line per game, pipe-separated:
#   slug | collection project folder | game file | lesson file (or -) | extra files (comma-separated, or -)
# Paths are relative to the collection's projects/ directory and the
# game's own project folder. The game file and its lesson are copied as
# siblings into dist/games/<slug>/ so the relative links between them
# (including the in-game lesson pop-ups) work unchanged. Extra files are
# support files a game page needs (Stack-a-Bot lives inside the Games
# Room page and brings its scripts and styles along).
siege-demolition|everyday-physics|siege-demolition.html|siege-demolition-lesson.html|-
bridge-builder-truss|everyday-physics|bridge-builder-truss.html|bridge-builder-truss-lesson.html|-
orbital-pinball|everyday-physics|orbital-pinball.html|orbital-pinball-lesson.html|-
orbital-gravity-golf|everyday-physics|orbital-gravity-golf.html|orbital-gravity-golf-lesson.html|-
lunar-lander-cave|everyday-physics|lunar-lander-cave.html|lunar-lander-cave-lesson.html|-
docking|everyday-physics|docking.html|docking-lesson.html|-
hill-climb-suspension|everyday-physics|hill-climb-suspension.html|hill-climb-suspension-lesson.html|-
stage-it|everyday-physics|stage-it.html|stage-it-lesson.html|-
jelly-softbody-platformer|everyday-physics|jelly-softbody-platformer.html|jelly-softbody-platformer-lesson.html|-
falling-sand-sandbox|everyday-physics|falling-sand-sandbox.html|falling-sand-sandbox-lesson.html|-
pendulum-grapple-swinger|everyday-physics|pendulum-grapple-swinger.html|pendulum-grapple-swinger-lesson.html|-
marble-run|everyday-physics|marble-run.html|marble-run-lesson.html|-
ballast|everyday-physics|ballast.html|ballast-lesson.html|-
air-hockey-curl|everyday-physics|air-hockey-curl.html|air-hockey-curl-lesson.html|-
ragdoll-archery-duel|everyday-physics|ragdoll-archery-duel.html|ragdoll-archery-duel-lesson.html|-
pool-table-physics|everyday-physics|pool-table-physics.html|pool-table-physics-lesson.html|-
